'''Headbanger's Ball''' (チームヘッドバンギング, ''Chīmu Heddobangingu'', '''Team Headbanging''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

